Third-party components
======================

This project is built on kichikuou/xsystem4 (GPL-2.0-or-later) and bundles or
links the following components:

  engine/subprojects/libsys4      GPL-2.0-or-later (same project family)
  engine/subprojects/cglm.wrap    MIT (cglm)
  SDL2 / SDL2_image / SDL2_mixer  zlib licence
  libpng, zlib                    libpng licence / zlib licence
  libjpeg-turbo                   BSD-3-Clause / IJG
  libwebp                         BSD-3-Clause
  freetype                        FreeType licence (FTL) or GPL-2.0
  libffi                          MIT
  libdeflate                      MIT
  libogg, libvorbis               BSD-3-Clause
  libsndfile                      LGPL-2.1-or-later

Fonts packaged for the Android build:

  HanaMinA (花園明朝)             HanaMin licence (see assets/licenses/HanaMinA)
  Noto Sans CJK SC                SIL Open Font License 1.1
  VL Gothic                       see assets/licenses/VL-Gothic-Regular

Prebuilt ARM64 dependency libraries under android/deps were produced from the
upstream projects above; their licences are reproduced in
android/project/app/src/main/assets/licenses/.

Rance 10 and all game assets are copyright AliceSoft and are NOT part of this
repository. You must own the game to build a playable package.
